@startuml
title Todo - Get Todo List (GET /api/todos)
hide footbox
actor Client
participant TodoController
participant TodoService
participant TodoSpecifications
participant TodoRepository

Client -> TodoController: GET /api/todos?keyword=..&status=..&page=..&size=..
note right of Client: Already authenticated by JwtAuthenticationFilter\nSecurityConfig: /api/todos/** requires role USER

TodoController -> TodoService: getTodos(principal.getUserId(), keyword, status, pageable)
TodoService -> TodoSpecifications: forUser(userId, keyword, status)
TodoSpecifications -> TodoSpecifications: predicate = (todo.user.userId == userId)
opt keyword != null AND !keyword.isBlank()
    TodoSpecifications -> TodoSpecifications: predicate AND lower(title) LIKE %keyword%
end
opt status != null
    TodoSpecifications -> TodoSpecifications: predicate AND status == status
end
TodoSpecifications --> TodoService: Specification<Todo>
TodoService -> TodoRepository: findAll(specification, pageable)
TodoRepository --> TodoService: Page<Todo>
TodoService -> TodoService: page.map(TodoResponse::from)
TodoService --> TodoController: Page<TodoResponse>
TodoController --> Client: 200 OK (Page<TodoResponse>)
@enduml